      <h2 id="nw-network-flows-delete_tracking-network-flows" class="group scroll-mt-20">Deleting all destinations for network flows collectors<a href="#nw-network-flows-delete_tracking-network-flows" class="ml-2 text-muted-foreground opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 no-underline" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1">&para;</a></h2>
      <p>As a cluster administrator, you can configure the Cluster Network Operator (CNO) to stop sending network flows metadata to a network flows collector.</p>
      <p><strong>Prerequisites</strong></p>
      <ul>
      <li>You installed the OpenShift CLI (<code>oc</code>).</li>
